{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-10-25 02:00:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP AND MAREX TO EXPAND CLIENT ACCESS TO CME GROUP ALUMINUM FUTURES', 'text': 'LONDON AND CHICAGO , OCT. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD\'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, AND MAREX, ONE OF THE LARGEST GLOBAL METALS BROKERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MAREX WILL EXPAND ITS CLIENTS\' ACCESS TO CME GROUP\'S BASE METALS MARKETS, STARTING FIRST WITH CME GROUP\'S GLOBAL ALUMINUM FUTURES CONTRACT. "WE CONTINUE TO MAKE TREMENDOUS PROGRESS IN GROWING OUR PHYSICALLY-DELIVERED ALUMINUM FUTURES AND OFFERING MARKET PARTICIPANTS AN ALTERNATIVE WAY TO MANAGE THEIR ALUMINUM PRICE RISK," SAID JIN CHANG, MANAGING DIRECTOR AND GLOBAL HEAD OF METALS AT CME GROUP.'}